  diff, go, html, java, javascript, json, kotlin-ng, lua, markdown (`tree-sitter-md`), php, python, ruby, rust, sequel (SQL),
  swift, toml-ng, typescript (TypeScript and TSX), yaml and zig, each from its own repository on crates.io. The highlight
  queries in `native/app/src/highlight/engine/queries/` are this app's own, written over the grammars' node names; where
